{
  "info": {
    "name": "Court Reporting Workflow API",
    "description": "REST API for the Court Reporting Workflow Manager.\n\n**Base URL:** https://court-reporting-workflow-manager.onrender.com\n\n> The backend is hosted on Render's free tier and sleeps after 15 minutes of inactivity. The first request after a cold start may take 30–60 seconds. Call **Health → Healthcheck** first to wake it up.\n\n## Suggested run order\n\n1. **Health → Healthcheck**\n2. **Reporters → List reporters** (take note of an id)\n3. **Editors → List editors** (take note of an id)\n4. **Jobs → Create job** (gets id back)\n5. **Jobs → Assign reporter** (status → ASSIGNED)\n6. **Jobs → Advance status** with `TRANSCRIBED`\n7. **Jobs → Assign editor** (job must be TRANSCRIBED)\n8. **Jobs → Advance status** with `REVIEWED`\n9. **Jobs → Advance status** with `COMPLETED`\n10. **Jobs → Payment summary** to see totals",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://court-reporting-workflow-manager.onrender.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jobId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Replace with an actual job id from List jobs response"
    },
    {
      "key": "reporterId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "editorId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Healthcheck",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Liveness check. Use this to wake up the Render backend before running other requests."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Jobs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List jobs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "jobs"]
            },
            "description": "Returns all jobs with their assigned reporter and editor."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get job by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "jobs", "{{jobId}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create job",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"caseName\": \"Smith vs Jones Co.\",\n  \"durationMinutes\": 90,\n  \"locationType\": \"PHYSICAL\",\n  \"city\": \"Jakarta\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "jobs"]
            },
            "description": "Required fields: `caseName`, `durationMinutes`, `locationType` (PHYSICAL or REMOTE).\n\n`city` is required when `locationType=PHYSICAL`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Suggest reporter",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/suggest-reporter",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "jobs", "{{jobId}}", "suggest-reporter"]
            },
            "description": "Recommends an available reporter for this job. Prefers same-city reporters for physical jobs."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign reporter",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reporterId\": {{reporterId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/assign-reporter",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "jobs", "{{jobId}}", "assign-reporter"]
            },
            "description": "Job must be in `NEW` status. After assignment the job auto-transitions to `ASSIGNED`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign editor",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"editorId\": {{editorId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/assign-editor",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "jobs", "{{jobId}}", "assign-editor"]
            },
            "description": "Job must be in `TRANSCRIBED` status."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Advance status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"TRANSCRIBED\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "jobs", "{{jobId}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Move job to the next status. Allowed flow:\n\n`NEW → ASSIGNED → TRANSCRIBED → REVIEWED → COMPLETED`\n\nRules:\n- Forward-only, one step at a time\n- Cannot reach TRANSCRIBED without an assigned reporter\n- Cannot reach REVIEWED without an assigned editor"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Job payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/payment",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "jobs", "{{jobId}}", "payment"]
            },
            "description": "Per-job payment breakdown. Reporter earns once assigned; editor earns only when status reaches REVIEWED."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Payment summary",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/payments/summary",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "jobs", "payments", "summary"]
            },
            "description": "Per-job earnings + grand totals across all jobs."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Reporters",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List reporters",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reporters",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "reporters"]
            },
            "description": "Returns all reporters with `activeJobCount` (number of non-COMPLETED jobs they're on)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create reporter",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n  \"location\": \"Jakarta\",\n  \"ratePerMinute\": 2500,\n  \"available\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reporters",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "reporters"]
            },
            "description": "Required: `name`, `location`. Optional: `ratePerMinute` (default 2000), `available` (default true)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update reporter",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"available\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reporters/{{reporterId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "reporters", "{{reporterId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update any subset of fields: `name`, `location`, `ratePerMinute`, `available`. Use this to toggle a reporter on or off the roster."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Editors",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List editors",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/editors",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "editors"]
            },
            "description": "Returns all editors with `activeJobCount`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create editor",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Smith\",\n  \"flatFee\": 50000,\n  \"available\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/editors",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "editors"]
            },
            "description": "Required: `name`. Optional: `flatFee` (default 50000 IDR), `available` (default true)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update editor",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"available\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/editors/{{editorId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "editors", "{{editorId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update any subset of fields: `name`, `flatFee`, `available`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
